{"name":"v42.2","tag_name":"v42.2","description":"CHANGES WITH v42.2\n\n        Changes in hooks:\n\n        * install/systemd includes systemd-tpm2-setup-early.service and\n          systemd-pcrnvdone.service because of changes in systemd v262. They are\n          required to initialize NvPCRs and to measure a separator into PCR 9.\n          Note that this does not fix the issue of failing units with UKIs built\n          by mkinitcpio itself. systemd v262 requires that the UKI must be\n          signed with a PCR policy and there is still no solution for that\n          without using ukify.\n\n        Contributions from: Aidan Dang, nl6720\n\n        - 2026-10-01","created_at":"2026-10-01T07:10:00.872Z","released_at":"2026-10-01T07:10:00.872Z","upcoming_release":false,"author":{"id":51,"username":"nl6720","public_email":"","name":"nl6720","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/141a7da0db814ce03285a7266a27e891a48059d469864d68be686d95f39c46b7?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/nl6720"},"commit":{"id":"e5433c2e3cb8f80dc77708b01d841a7f4dc864a0","short_id":"e5433c2e","created_at":"2026-10-01T09:52:44.000+03:00","parent_ids":["2b36499cc03a226d4e9f3b1fab58860f4432d627"],"title":"Changelog for v42.2","message":"Changelog for v42.2\n\nUpdate and sort the `AUTHORS` file.\n","author_name":"nl6720","author_email":"devnull@nl6720.me","authored_date":"2026-10-01T09:48:57.000+03:00","committer_name":"nl6720","committer_email":"devnull@nl6720.me","committed_date":"2026-10-01T09:52:44.000+03:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/mkinitcpio/mkinitcpio/-/commit/e5433c2e3cb8f80dc77708b01d841a7f4dc864a0"},"milestones":[{"id":222,"iid":22,"project_id":20028,"title":"v42.2","description":"","state":"closed","created_at":"2026-09-27T06:08:22.866Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T07:10:13.134Z","due_date":"2026-10-01","start_date":"2026-09-27","expired":true,"web_url":"http